    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n35429" root="قرث" body-key="q">
    
      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَرِثَ</span></b> , aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَرَثَ</span></b> , (O, K,) inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَرَثٌ</span>, (TA,) <i>He
toiled;</i> and <i>gained</i> or <i>earned,</i> or <i>sought gain</i> or
<i>sustenance.</i> (O, K.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَرَثَهُ الأَمْرُ</span> <i>i. q.</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَرَثَهُ</span>.
(K.) You say, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَرَثَنِى الأَمْرُ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَرَثَنِى</span>, meaning
<i>The affair,</i> or <i>event, grieved me;</i> and <i>burdened
me heavily,</i> or <i>overburdened me.</i> (As, O.)

